    }
  ],
  "translation": "Yoashi, Isirayɛl masakɛ, y'a ci Amatsiyahu, Yuda masakɛ ma, ko: Hahun min bɛ Lubnan (Lebanɔ) na, a y'a ci sedɛr (jiriba) min bɛ Lubnan na ma, ko: I denmuso di n'i denkɛ ye muso ye; nka forobagan min bɛ Lubnan na, a tɛmɛna, ka hahun hugun.",
